==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chemistry}} Any ion containing more than one [[atom]]. e.g. [[sulphate]] as opposed to [[sulphide]].
# {{lb|en|chemistry}} Any ion in which a [[central]] [[metal]] [[atom]] (normally a [[transition element]]) is surrounded by a group of [[ion]]s or [[molecule]]s ([[ligand]]s). e.g. [[ferricyanide]].

